<span id="S4.SS3.p2.1.1.1.1.1.1.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">SP-HP-ConvoT-MDE with Parts</span>
<span id="S4.SS3.p2.1.1.1.1.1.1.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">82.0</span></span>
